    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35530" root="قرطس" body-key="q">
    
      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرْطَسَ</span></b> , (Msb, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرْطَسَةٌ</span>, (Msb,)
<i>He</i> (an archer) [and <i>it</i> (an arrow)] <i>hit the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِرْطَاس</span>
[or <i>target</i>]. (Msb, K.) It is also allowable to say,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرْطَسَتِ الرَّمْيَةُ</span> <i>The shot went right to the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِرْطَاس</span>.
(Msb.)

